OL,3,APoland says fire at Starlink station is
OL,4,Asabotage as Denmark warns of rising
OL,5,ARussian threat
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe told Polish public broadcaster TVP
OL,8,FInfo an investigation was ongoing but
OL,9,F"many indications suggest" the attack
OL,10,Ffits into a "new Russian doctrine of
OL,11,Fattack". The Kremlin has not commented.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Denmark's intelligence
OL,14,Fservice issued a new threat assessment
OL,15,Fsaying it expects Russia to escalate
OL,16,Fhybrid warfare in the coming months.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
