OL,3,AEthiopia's army says it has repelled
OL,4,Aattacks in first comment on fresh
OL,5,Afighting
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe developments come as tensions
OL,8,Fbetween the federal government and
OL,9,FTigrayan leaders have sharply escalated
OL,10,Fover the last few days, raising fears
OL,11,Fthat a devastating civil war could
OL,12,Fresume.
OL,14,FOn Wednesday, the Tigray People's
OL,15,FLiberation Front (TPLF), which
OL,16,Fdominates the region, seized control of
OL,17,Fthree airports from federal police.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
